  "date": "2026-10-22",
  "header": "**This is a monitor, not a claim.** It scores every pre-tip source on every player-prop line it priced, descriptively. It is not a decision rule, it pre-registers nothing, and no CI here supports a conclusion. Decisions come only from frozen rules. Sources price different line sets, so standalone scores are NOT comparable across rows; only the paired differences against the Kalshi mid (on lines both priced) are like-for-like. Lower Brier / log loss is better; a negative difference means the source beat Kalshi on the shared lines.",
